{"title":"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A square is cut into two identical rectangles, as shown.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Each of these two rectangles has perimeter 24 cm. What is the area of the original square?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> be the height of one of the rectangles. Since sides of a square are equal and the side length of the square is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times this, the width of the rectangles must both be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/3/7d3914c5607bf46949390af4e088bb17107565ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2h$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />. The sum of the sides lengths of each rectangle is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/4/b147a234da137b4a0bc6f9f03eb7ae5e1498174c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h + 2h = 3h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>The perimeter of a rectangle is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times the sum of its two side lengths, so the sum of the side lengths must be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/2/ff2ba24d372e309d318be8518ca7849bf4329a80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24}{2} = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"66\" height=\"38\" />. This means:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/6/196dc5f743b0db11bce1337eaa46ef925b2245a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3h = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/c/7ec2d21793600c4efe4d75d2f29c8ec9bdde52a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h = \\frac{12}{3} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/9/759ed967199e05a556aba1e4b227b37095ae3ec1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{cm}$\" width=\"21\" height=\"7\" />\n</p><p>This means that the side length of the square is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/e/e9e6fd39729fd0f13a9b723a318c6ff8d3b82e89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 4 = 8 \\text{cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" />. Thus, the area of the original square was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/1/8e181ad8da0d5b2d317a80215dd9c00e3052c4ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{2} = \\boxed{64 \\text{ cm}^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"106\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC\" title=\"2020 CSMC\">2020 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018063014\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 101/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1693/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 134/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1942/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.417      1 -total\n 48.10%    6.935      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n 37.57%    5.416      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37337:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018063014 and revision id 288326. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}